at they maybe they want to hear  my whole thoughts on it we'll see  but yeah ratings are there there have  been various points over times where  I've been asked you know will you do  this will you do that and I've said no I  will never do that and more often than  not I've ultimately perjured myself on  that because often times you know if  it's about a certain topic the mere  asking will you talk about this gets me  thinking about if it's something that I  care about like I I still get people  asking me like will I ever review Sonic  the Hedgehog anything and the answer to  that is just it's just no it's not my  fandom I don't have a dog in that race  I'm sorry but you know so aside from  sort of those sort of situations I do  have it I have had a tendency in the  past to say no I will never talk about  this and then ultimately end up doing it  here though I'm drawing a hard line I'm  never never gonna do ratings cuz for me  and what I do and my approach to this  there's no benefit for me to do that  it's nothing but a hassle it's stress  for me to try and figure it out  especially if I'm gonna worry about the  precedent of what other things I have or  haven't given this rating or a higher or  lower rating before knowing that other  people out there are keeping track I  don't buy I just know I never want to  deal with that that takes away enjoyment  from me for doing this so those are my  reasons why I don't use a rating system  not numbers not grades not what I made  up and I never will so rating systems  what are your thoughts on them do you  have a preferred one do you like an 8 an  A+ to F do you like a stars rating do  you like like the unique custom ones  that some reviewers have come up with  whatever your thoughts are drop  something down the comments let's talk  about it whole bunch of stuff you can do  because there's buttons and there's  links including a link to my patreon if  you're in a generous mood if not though  don't worry about it you know there'